            "reviewBody": "This drink is amazing!! The recipe is perfect as is, but when we ran out of chocolate liqueur, we substituted kahlua and a bit of hazlenut cream, and it was just as good!\n\nGreat drink, but be warned - it can do some damage ;o)"
