              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dawn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was so looking forward to trying this cocktail. I was going to get the ingredients to make it this past weekend but didn't get to the liquor store. But when my boyfriend and I stopped at a bar I asked the bartender to make it for us. WOW - it is strong and I usually don't complain about that. I think measurements are off ... I'd have to play with it to figure out what they should be but this definitely isn't it. Also it might benefit from a splash of cream or 1/2&amp;/1/2 to smooth it out.",
            "datePublished": "2010-04-26T06:03:56.110Z"
          },
